  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A pump has efficiency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"η\"></span> when raising water from a well of depth <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"d\"></span>. The mass of water raised per second is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span>. Changes in kinetic energy of the water are considered negligible.</p>\n<p>What is the input power to the pump required to raise the water?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Rd}{ηg}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{ηR}{gd}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"ηRgd\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Rdg}{η}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
